On the TidyOS hotspot set to Reach TidyOS, the phone has no internet while it's joined. Settings > Run TidyOS Hotspot: turn it off and on again and choose Keep phone internet, rejoin the Wi-Fi on the phone, open http://10.1.1.250 and try again.

Otherwise check that the phone has mobile data or other internet.␀Update␀Your phone can reach GitHub. Restart and update through it?

